# Same no-implicit-recursion rule as the root file: bare names match only the
# context root, so nested caches need the ** form to stay out of the image.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.turbo

# pydantic-settings reads a .env from the working directory, so never ship one.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

.git
tests
